  "Sign in to VRChat": "登录 VRChat",
  "The password is used for this one request and is never stored.": "密码仅用于这一次请求，绝不会被保存。",
  "Username or email": "用户名或邮箱",
  "Password": "密码",
  "Signing in…": "登录中…",
  "Use a device code": "使用设备代码",
  "Signing in is optional. Without it AntiBot only reads VRChat's local log, so the instance list can be inaccurate and player details are unavailable. The password is used for this one request and is never stored; the session is kept out of the settings folder.": "登录是可选的。不登录时 AntiBot 只读取 VRChat 本地日志，实例列表可能不准确，玩家详情不可用。密码仅用于这一次请求，绝不会被保存；会话不会放在设置文件夹中。",
  "Two-factor authentication": "双重验证",
  "VRChat wants a second factor before it hands over the session.": "VRChat 需要第二重验证才会交出会话。",
  "Verifying…": "验证中…",
  "Verify": "验证",
  "Unlock with Windows Hello": "使用 Windows Hello 解锁",
  "Unlock the saved session": "解锁已保存的会话",
  "The session is protected by Windows Hello. Confirm with your PIN, fingerprint or face.": "会话受 Windows Hello 保护。请使用 PIN、指纹或面部确认。",
  "The session was encrypted with a key derived from your password. It is never stored, so it has to be typed again.": "会话使用由密码派生的密钥加密。密钥不会被保存，因此需要再次输入。",
  "Unlocking…": "解锁中…",
  "Unlock": "解锁",
  "Forget it": "忘记",
