  "Session expires {date}": "会话到期 {date}",
  "Sign out": "退出登录",
  "Keep the session between launches": "在启动之间保留会话",
  "Only the VRChat session cookie is stored, never your password. Every mode except \"Do not remember\" encrypts it at rest; the difference is what unlocks it.": "只保存 VRChat 会话 Cookie，绝不保存密码。除“不记住”外，所有模式都会加密保存，区别在于解锁方式。",
  "Software key": "软件密钥",
  "obfuscation": "混淆",
  "weak": "弱",
  "Linux": "Linux",
  "AES-256-GCM with a key file next to the session; obfuscation only, not real protection.": "使用会话旁的密钥文件进行 AES-256-GCM 加密；只是混淆，不是真正的保护。",
  "encrypted": "加密",
  "fair": "一般",
  "Windows": "Windows",
  "Windows · Linux": "Windows · Linux",
  "Encrypted with Windows DPAPI for your account; unlocks automatically.": "使用 Windows DPAPI 绑定到你的账户，自动解锁。",
  "Held in the desktop keyring; unlocks with your login session.": "保存在桌面钥匙串中，随登录会话解锁。",
