  "Could not read the settings.": "无法读取设置。",
  "Log source": "日志来源",
  "configurable": "可配置",
  "VRChat log folder": "VRChat 日志文件夹",
  "VRChat's log folder": "VRChat 日志文件夹",
  "The newest log in this folder is followed while VRChat is running. Nothing is read while it is closed.": "VRChat 运行时跟随此文件夹中最新的日志。关闭时不会读取。",
  "Open folder": "打开文件夹",
  "Use VRChat's folder": "使用 VRChat 的文件夹",
  "Avatar name lookups": "头像名称查询",
  "same format as VRCX": "与 VRCX 相同格式",
  "API endpoints": "API 端点",
  "Tried in order; the first name wins. Each is called as": "按顺序尝试，第一个名称优先。调用格式：",
  "and must answer with JSON containing a": "并且必须返回包含以下字段的 JSON：",
  "No endpoint; avatar names stay unknown.": "没有端点；头像名称将保持未知。",
  "Avatar API endpoint": "头像 API 端点",
  "Remove endpoint": "删除端点",
  "New avatar API endpoint": "新的头像 API 端点",
  "Add": "添加",
  "Automatic protection": "自动保护",
  "Threat threshold": "威胁度阈值",
  "Any user at or above this score is acted on; the score is a guess and can be wrong. Friends and whitelisted users are never acted on.": "达到此分数的用户会被执行以下操作。分数只是推测，可能有误判。好友和白名单用户永远不会被处理。",
  "Block the user": "屏蔽用户",
  "Block the user. VRChat may then refuse to send them your avatar if it checks blocks on the server; it may also have no effect.": "屏蔽该用户。如果 VRChat 在服务器端检查屏蔽关系，可能会拒绝把您的头像发送给对方；但也可能没有效果。",
  "Disable avatar interactions": "关闭头像互动",
  "Turn the user's avatar interactions off, so their avatar cannot trigger anything on yours.": "关闭该用户的头像互动，避免对方的头像对您的头像触发任何东西。",
  "Hide the chat box": "隐藏聊天框",
  "Hide the user's chat box, so they cannot flood or harass through it.": "隐藏该用户的聊天框，避免刷屏和骚扰。",
  "Close VRChat": "关闭 VRChat",
  "Close VRChat, so the client has as little chance as possible to download and cache their avatar.": "关闭 VRChat，尽量让客户端没有机会下载并缓存对方的头像。",
  "Skip while in VR": "VR 模式下跳过",
  "Do not close VRChat while a VR headset is in use; quitting from VR is disruptive.": "使用 VR 头显时不关闭 VRChat，因为在 VR 中退出很麻烦。",
  "Closed VRChat": "已关闭 VRChat",
  "Asks VRChat to quit normally, so the client tells the instance it is leaving.": "正常关闭 VRChat，客户端会通知实例自己已离开。",
  "VRChat closed.": "已关闭 VRChat。",
  "VRChat did not close. Is it running?": "VRChat 没有关闭。它是否在运行？",
  "Safe Mode (OSC)": "安全模式 (OSC)",
  "Turn on VRChat's Safe Mode over OSC when a user reaches the threshold, so every non-friend avatar is replaced at once. It needs OSC enabled in VRChat and stays on until you turn it off.": "出现达到阈值的用户时，通过 OSC 打开 VRChat 的安全模式，一次性替换所有非好友的头像。需要在 VRChat 中启用 OSC，并且会一直保持开启直到你手动关闭。",
  "Safe Mode on": "安全模式已开启",
  "Safe Mode on.": "已开启安全模式。",
  "Safe Mode is already on.": "安全模式已经是开启状态。",
  "VRChat is not listening for OSC. Enable it in the Action Menu.": "VRChat 没有在监听 OSC，请在快捷菜单中启用。",
  "Presses VRChat's panic button over OSC, which replaces every non-friend avatar at once.": "通过 OSC 按下 VRChat 的紧急按钮，一次性替换所有非好友的头像。",
  "Switch avatar (OSC)": "切换头像 (OSC)",
  "Switch to another avatar over OSC when a user reaches the threshold. It is not switched back.": "出现达到阈值的用户时，通过 OSC 切换到另一个头像。不会自动换回。",
  "Safe avatar id": "安全头像 ID",
  "Only avatars in your favourites, your recents or your own uploads can be used. Copy the id (avtr_…) from the avatar's page on vrchat.com.": "只能使用收藏、最近使用或自己上传的头像。请从 vrchat.com 的头像页面复制 ID（avtr_…）。",
  "Show the avatar id": "显示头像 ID",
  "Hide the avatar id": "隐藏头像 ID",
  "Switched avatar": "已切换头像",
  "Avatar changed.": "已切换头像。",
  "Already wearing that avatar.": "已经是该头像了。",
  "Set the avatar id in the settings first.": "请先在设置中填写头像 ID。",
  "Asks VRChat to wear the avatar id from the settings.": "要求 VRChat 换上设置中填写的头像。",
  "Working…": "执行中…",
  "Reject friend requests": "拒绝好友请求",
  "Reject friend requests from any user at or above the threshold. VRChat's notification is hidden and the actions above are applied to the sender; the request stays in AntiBot's list as rejected, where it can be undone.": "拒绝达到阈值的用户发来的好友请求。VRChat 的通知会被隐藏，上面的操作会应用到发送者；请求仍会以“已拒绝”保留在 AntiBot 的列表中，可以在那里撤销。",
  "Whitelist": "白名单",
  "never acted on": "不会被处理",
  "Add a user": "添加用户",
  "Whitelisted user id": "白名单用户 ID",
  "Paste a VRChat user id. Whitelisted users get a white row and no automatic action.": "粘贴 VRChat 用户 ID。白名单用户显示为白色行，且不会触发自动操作。",
  "Nobody is whitelisted.": "白名单中没有人。",
  "Remove from whitelist": "从白名单移除",
  "Build": "构建",
  "app.info": "app.info",
  "Version": "版本",
  "Read from the executable the interface is running in.": "从界面所在的执行文件读取。",
  "Language": "语言",
